# VibeTrunk — home
# Static site, no server-side code — nothing here is required to build or run.
#
# VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN in .env.local is written automatically by `vercel link` /
# `vercel env pull` — never add a value for it here or commit it.
#
# Future VibeTrunk-org repos with real env vars (e.g. the Supabase-backed
# Hitster game) should list names with empty values only, e.g.:
#   PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
#   PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# The service_role key must NEVER be PUBLIC_-prefixed, never ships to the
# client, and never appears in any .env.example.
